    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.2",
      "title": "Specific Requirements",
      "body": "Chainmail Aventails must follow the General Requirements (see Section 3 above).\n\nThe outer edge of the chainmail Aventail must be securely stitched to a padded pelerine to prevent displacement.\n\nThe aventail must cover the shoulders, throat, and neck at all times without gaps.\n\nChainmail Aventail must be properly maintained: damaged rings must be replaced, rust must be removed, etc.",
