      "title": "Historical Sources and Datation",
      "body": "Scales Aventail consist of metal scales riveted to a leather or fabric base. Though no artifacts remain, they can be documented in manuscripts.\n\nThey are Approved for 14th century, Transitional and 15th century armors.\n\nBook of Hours - 1425/1435 - France Concerning the Fates of Illustrious Men and Women - 1415 - France\n\nSint-Martinusbasiliek - 1409 - Belgium",
