    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "5.2",
      "title": "Specific Requirements",
      "body": "Scales Aventails must follow the General Requirements (see Section 3 above).\n\nScales must be contoured (not flat) and securely riveted to the pelerine for a proper fit and protection.\nAllowed shapes include square, triangular, and semicircular designs.\n\nScales must lay evenly and overlap slightly to ensure full protection with no gaps.\n\nScales Aventail must conform to the “Armors and Weapons Aesthetics and Decorations” document.",
